{
  "_readme": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json and put the real token in, then any agent opened in this",
    "repo can search the B-roll library without downloading video.",
    "",
    "Get the block with the token already filled in from",
    "https://cyrusstudio.space/broll/ -> Connect an agent -> Copy agent brief.",
    "",
    ".mcp.json is gitignored on purpose. The token is a credential: anything",
    "holding it can read and download the whole library. Committing it to a repo",
    "is the likeliest way it ever leaks -- far likelier than anyone intercepting",
    "it, since every request is over TLS.",
    "",
    "It grants strictly less than the studio password does: read-only, one",
    "library, no write path of any kind. It can be rotated without locking",
    "anyone out of the studio, because it is deliberately not the same secret."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "nowa-broll": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://cyrusstudio.space/api/broll/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE"
      }
    }
  }
}
